<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Dow Chemical said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Dow Chemical said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber cut its rating of Dow Chemical Co to unattractive from neutral, according to a source at the broker.</p>
<p>-- Shares of Dow were off 1-1/2 to 87-3/8 in early trading on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
